  "notes": "Official cause code is TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields; category set to 'provisional' accordingly, though narrative clearly attributes this to human-performance/procedure-use error (faulty application of EN-HU-102). Train A isolation signal removal on 03/12/2020 is background context establishing why loss of Train B signal resulted in full loss of isolation; not modeled as separate FailureMode chain since it predates and is peripheral to the reported event chain but is referenced in fm_procstep description. HVC-101/102 opening is the observable manifestation, modeled as components affected by fm_lossofsignal rather than a separate FailureMode since narrative frames valve opening as the direct effect of losing the isolation signal. No block_13 rows provided in FORM-366 fields, so block_13 array is empty per authoritative source."
